Package: kolinos-tools
Architecture: @KOLIN_DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: KolinOS <dev@kolinos.org>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: bash
Description: KolinOS command-line tools
 Small utilities shipped by the KolinOS distribution: kolinos-info (a
 neofetch-style system summary with the KolinOS branding), kolinos-version
 (name, version and codename), apt-kolinos (enable or disable the
 distribution's own APT repository) and kolinos-firstboot (the one-time
 setup that runs after the system is installed).
